    "duration": 4.0,
    "start": 0.0,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "大家好，欢迎来到《本体工程与知识图谱实战》第一集。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.256,
    "start": 4.0,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "很多朋友听过知识图谱、GraphRAG、数据编织，但一说到「本体」就懵了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "turn_index": 0,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "start": 9.256,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "今天我们不写代码，先回答一个基础问题：本体到底解决什么问题？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 1.84,
    "start": 13.816,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "对，这个问题很关键。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "turn_index": 1,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "start": 15.656,
    "slide": 1,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "没搞清楚痛点，工具再熟也容易用错地方。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.56,
    "start": 18.696,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "我用三个问题串起本期内容：一个客服问题为什么会难住 AI？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.16,
    "start": 23.256,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "数据孤岛、语义不一致、LLM 幻觉有什么联系？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "turn_index": 2,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.72,
    "start": 27.416,
    "slide": 2,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "为什么本体是企业 AI 落地的必修课？"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.52,
    "start": 30.136,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "先看一个制造业场景。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.96,
    "start": 31.656,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "客户打电话问：「我的订单为什么延迟？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "turn_index": 3,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 8.88,
    "start": 34.616,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "」客服 AI 要同时查五个系统：ERP 的订单、MES 的工序、WMS 的库存、物流的发货记录、客服的历史工单。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.28,
    "start": 43.496,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "更麻烦的是，每个系统对同一个东西叫法不同。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.16,
    "start": 46.776,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "ERP 里的订单号，MES 叫生产批次，物流又叫运单号。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "turn_index": 4,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 2.32,
    "start": 50.936,
    "slide": 3,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "AI 要么答错，要么只能回答不知道。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "start": 53.256,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "有人反驳：这不就是数据中台该干的事吗？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "turn_index": 5,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.84,
    "start": 56.296,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "把数据抽到一块不就行了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.48,
    "start": 58.136,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "数据中台解决的是存得下和查得快，但没解决讲同一个故事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.96,
    "start": 62.616,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "同一个人在 CRM 是联系人，在 ERP 是开票主体，在物流是收件人。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "turn_index": 6,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.04,
    "start": 67.576,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "技术上同一个 ID，语义上未必是同一回事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.0,
    "start": 70.616,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "这就是痛点一：数据孤岛不是问题，语义孤岛才是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "turn_index": 7,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 8.08,
    "start": 74.616,
    "slide": 4,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "Fluree 调研显示，56% 的企业把数据孤岛列为 AI 落地最大障碍，自认数据完全 AI-ready 的只有 7%。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.24,
    "start": 82.696,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第二个痛点更隐蔽：同一个词，不同部门说的不是一回事。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "turn_index": 8,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.12,
    "start": 86.936,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "同一个人，财务叫 client、CRM 叫 customer、ERP 叫 account。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 8.047,
    "start": 92.056,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "TigerGraph 有个案例，生物科技公司让大模型直接抽取临床试验概念，结果一个 Phase 3 临床试验被抽出了 17 种互不兼容的说法。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "turn_index": 9,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 3.76,
    "start": 100.103,
    "slide": 5,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "术语不统一靠业务规范只能约束人，约束不了机器。"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.466,
    "start": 103.863,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "说到这，我们可以把「本体」请出来了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.72,
    "start": 106.329,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "前面两个痛点的共同根因，是企业数据没有一张共享的语义地图。"
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "turn_index": 10,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.68,
    "start": 111.049,
    "slide": 6,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "本体，就是这张地图。"
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.96,
    "start": 112.729,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "本体是对某个领域概念、关系、约束的形式化、可共享、显式说明。"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "turn_index": 11,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 9.484,
    "start": 117.689,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "它和 ER 图不一样：ER 图是给人看的数据库设计，本体是给机器理解的语义层，能说明客户和订单的业务关系，以及订单什么状态下算已完成。"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.52,
    "start": 127.173,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "数据字典也不一样。"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.52,
    "start": 128.693,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "数据字典是静态标签，本体还包含关系方向和业务规则，能支撑推理。"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "turn_index": 12,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 3.2,
    "start": 134.213,
    "slide": 7,
    "sentence_index": 2,
    "text": "RDF 和 OWL 是两种常见表达格式。"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.04,
    "start": 137.413,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "第三个痛点和大模型直接相关：LLM 会猜，而且猜得很自信。"
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "turn_index": 13,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.6,
    "start": 142.453,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "企业字段命名晦涩，业务规则藏在文档里，LLM 只能靠概率猜。"
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 4.88,
    "start": 148.053,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "普通 LLM 直接回答企业问题，幻觉率能达到 20% 到 30%。"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "turn_index": 14,
    "role": "guest",
    "duration": 8.207,
    "start": 152.933,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "但用本体加 FDE 方法，可以把幻觉率压到 4% 以下，同时流程效率提升 55%，错误率下降 60%。"
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.96,
    "start": 161.139,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "有人问：给大模型写更好的 prompt 不够吗？"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "turn_index": 15,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 1.2,
    "start": 164.099,
    "slide": 8,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "为什么要建本体？"
