  {
    "index": 43,
    "turn_index": 17,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 2.785,
    "start": 185.92,
    "slide": 9,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "本体工程是跨行业的通用基础设施。"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.64,
    "start": 188.705,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 0,
    "text": "最后留三个关键认知：第一，数据孤岛本质是语义孤岛；"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 4.4,
    "start": 193.345,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 1,
    "text": "第二，LLM 不会自动理解业务，需要显式语义层约束；"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "turn_index": 18,
    "role": "host",
    "duration": 5.92,
    "start": 197.745,
    "slide": 10,
    "sentence_index": 2,
